<title>SPAIN: Spanish bonds end higher before Thursday's holiday.</title>
<headline>Spanish bonds end higher before Thursday's holiday.</headline>
<text>
<p>1520 GMT - Bonos end higher but off peaks on Wednesday after modest profit-taking ahead of a holiday on Thursday</p>
<p>* 10-yr 7.35 pct T-bond 106.00 vs 105.58, yield 6.51 vs 6.55</p>
<p>* June bond future 116.07 vs 115.76 at yesterday's close</p>
<p>* Peseta/mark 84.41/42 vs 84.57/59</p>
